<title>RUSSIA: Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5565/5595.</title>
<headline>Central bank dollar/rouble rates 5565/5595.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said it had set 5565/5595 roubles per dollar as its bid and offer rates for its operations on the currency market on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official rate for Thursday will be 5580.</p>
<p>On Monday the bid/offer rates were 5553/5593, with the official dollar rate 5573 from Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tuesday, January 7, was the Orthodox Christmas holiday in Russia.</p>
<p>The Central Bank announces daily bid/offer dollar/rouble rates for its currency operations. The midpoint of these rates is the official dollar/rouble rate for the following day.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
